'''Plusle''' (Japanese: '''プラスル''' ''Prasle'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

