==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Plusle|76}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*'''Electric Tail''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Plasma Freeze|Pachirisu|37}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Freeze}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

